# Brewfile.apps - the GUI apps I use on my Macs.
# The Mac App Store entries need an Apple ID signed in to the App Store first.
# Usage: brew bundle install --file Brewfile.apps

# Select apps for the host before installing. The Mac mini follows Serverfiles'
# docs/DEVELOPMENT.md; do not install this whole file there.
# Essentials. Install and sign in to the selected apps first.
